## Proposed Architecture & Data Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Employee as Flutter Mobile App
    participant Backend as Supabase (PostgreSQL & RPC)
    participant DB as Postgres Database
    participant Realtime as Supabase Realtime Engine
    actor HRAdmin as HR Web Portal

    Note over HRAdmin,DB: 1. Geofence & Assignment Configuration
    HRAdmin->>Backend: Save Work Location (Lat, Lng, Radius: 150m) & Assign Employee
    Backend->>DB: Upsert work_locations & employee_work_locations
    DB->>Realtime: Broadcast location/assignment update
    Realtime-->>Employee: Live Update: Location & Geofence Policy

    Note over Employee,Backend: 2. Authoritative Check-In Flow
    Employee->>Employee: Acquire Device GPS (Geolocator)
    Employee->>Backend: Call fn_validate_and_record_gps_attendance(lat, lng, accuracy, emp_id)
    Backend->>Backend: Calculate Haversine distance to nearest assigned location
    alt Inside Geofence (Distance <= Radius & Accuracy OK)
        Backend->>DB: Insert attendance_punches (Source: MOBILE_GPS)
        Backend->>DB: Upsert attendance_daily & log attendance_location_events
        Backend-->>Employee: Success: { inside: true, distance: 42m, location: "Coimbatore HQ" }
        DB->>Realtime: Broadcast attendance_punches & attendance_daily
        Realtime-->>HRAdmin: Live Feed: Check-in Present at 10:09 AM (MOBILE_GPS)
        Realtime-->>Employee: Live Home Screen: Checked In + Working Timer
    else Outside Geofence / Low Accuracy
        Backend->>DB: Log GPS Violation in attendance_location_events
        Backend-->>Employee: Rejected: { inside: false, distance: 184m, radius: 100m, reason: "OUTSIDE_GEOFENCE" }
        DB->>Realtime: Broadcast GPS violation event
        Realtime-->>HRAdmin: KPI update: GPS Violations Blocked +1
    end
```

