## Proposed Changes

### 1. Database & Supabase Migrations (`supabase/migrations/`)

#### [NEW] [20260826_production_gps_mobile_attendance_channel.sql](file:///j:/workforceos-enterprise-hrms/supabase/migrations/20260826_production_gps_mobile_attendance_channel.sql)
- Ensure tables: `work_locations`, `employee_work_locations`, `attendance_location_policy`, `attendance_location_events`.
- RPC `public.fn_get_employee_authorized_locations(p_tenant_id, p_employee_id)`: Dynamically resolves active, authorized work locations for an employee.
- RPC `public.fn_validate_and_record_gps_attendance(...)`:
  - Evaluates device GPS against authorized geofences (supports multiple assigned locations by picking the nearest).
  - Validates GPS accuracy against `accuracy_requirement_meters` / `max_accuracy_meters`.
  - Anti-spoof mock location check.
  - Inserts atomic punch record in `attendance_punches` with `source = 'MOBILE_GPS'`.
  - Updates `attendance_daily` with proper shift context (supports night shifts across midnight).
  - Logs audit event in `attendance_location_events` (with `PUNCH_CHECK_IN`, `PUNCH_CHECK_OUT`, `OUTSIDE_GEOFENCE`, `LOW_ACCURACY`, `MOCK_LOCATION`).
- Configures `REPLICA IDENTITY FULL` and adds tables to `supabase_realtime` publication.
- Sets up Row Level Security (RLS) policies for tenant and employee isolation.

